          "filename": "Hillend of Heateth - geograph.org.uk - 373765.jpg",
          "caption": "Hillend of Heateth This farm is located on the right bank of the Dippol Burn and in an area where there is much surrounding heathland vegetation. There is some improved grassland, some of which is grazed by 2 horses used for recreational riding, but the main interest would appear to be sheep rearing. There are also a few new areas around the farm where young deciduous trees have been planted.",
