          "path": "_m/g/c/u/g/auchinleck-wp/barony-junction-signalbox-1983.jpg",
          "filename": "Barony Junction signalbox 1983 - geograph.org.uk - 814965.jpg",
          "caption": "Barony Junction signalbox 1983 The box was manned only on the day shift, providing access to the colliery and for a train to shunt Auchinleck's coal depot. When the colliery closed, so did the box.  No railway personnel lamented: isolated and without road access, nobody ever volunteered to man this box.",
          "alt": "Barony Junction signalbox 1983 The box was manned only on the day shift, providing access to the colliery and for a train to shunt Auchinleck's coal depot. When the colliery closed, so did the box.  No railway personnel lamented: isolated and without road access, nobody ever volunteered to man this box.",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 427,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "Whatlep",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barony_Junction_signalbox_1983_-_geograph.org.uk_-_814965.jpg",
